section: ghc-lib
issues: #28002
mrs: !16841
synopsis:
  Use ``ShortByteString`` in the ``Serialized`` type instead of ``[Word8]``
description:
  Breaking change: All functions that previously handled annotations in ``[Word8]``
  form now use ``ShortByteString``. The following definitions have modified types:
  * ``GHC.findGlobalAnns``
  * ``GHC.Tc.Gen.Splice.getAnnotationsByTypeRep``
  * ``GHC.Core.Opt.Monad.getAnnotations``
  * ``GHC.Core.Opt.Monad.getFirstAnnotations``
  * ``GHC.Types.Annotations.deserializeAnns``
  * ``GHC.Types.Annotations.findAnns``
  * ``GHC.Types.Annotations.findAnnsByTypeRep``
  * ``GHC.Serialized.Serialized``
  * ``GHC.Serialized.toSerialized``
  * ``GHC.Serialized.fromSerialized``
  * ``GHC.Serialized.serializeWithData``
  * ``GHC.Serialized.deserializeWithData``
  * ``GHCi.Message.ReifyAnnotations``
